WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:04.190
Your next class starts with one clear
invitation.

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:07.885
Once you are accepted and your email is
verified,

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:13.050
scheduled class invitations bring the topic,
date, time zone,

00:00:13.597 --> 00:00:14.797
and joining link together.

00:00:16.155 --> 00:00:18.375
Check the time zone before adding the class
to

00:00:18.763 --> 00:00:19.143
your plans.

00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:22.370
When it is time, open the joining link in

00:00:23.146 --> 00:00:23.626
your invitation.

00:00:25.363 --> 00:00:27.643
You can also sign in to the Academy and open

00:00:28.347 --> 00:00:30.447
My classroom to find your scheduled class.

00:00:32.722 --> 00:00:35.376
If a class changes, check the latest update
and

00:00:36.472 --> 00:00:37.592
the current classroom details.

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:40.792
Need help finding your class?

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:44.030
Open Need help on the website and leave the

00:00:44.555 --> 00:00:45.595
Academy team a message.

00:00:46.238 --> 00:00:46.838
Check the details.

00:00:48.988 --> 00:00:50.208
Join your class.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:51.560
Bring your questions.
